    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/15_solu_phy_pa_2.jpg\" style=\"width: 212px; height: 118px;\" /><br />When switch is closed for a very long time capacitor will get fully charged and charge on capacitor will be&nbsp;<math><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br />Energy stored in capacitor&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.....(i)<br />Work done by battery&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Dissipated across resistance&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;= (work done by battery) &ndash; (energy store)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .....(ii)<br />From (i) and (ii)<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
